          H3("Velocity"),
          "Velocity is the amount of work, often in story points, that a team completes per Sprint. Averaged over several Sprints, it helps with Sprint Planning and release forecasts. It is a planning aid for one team, not a performance target, and it cannot be compared between teams. See our guide to [Scrum velocity](/project-management/scrum/scrum-velocity/).",
